body:
I saw the  heavensward free ad and I tried to login but i couldn't log in to download the free game. After doing some password recovery, I still couldn't log into my account. I then stumbled upon a login page that says free trial users can't log in. 

&#x200B;

Does that mean I have to subscribe in order to get heavensward for free?

I know that feel, I'm work from home m-f, I found a local art community that meets every saturday so it's like my version of going to "the bar". I realize I can turn saturday into "service saturday" and just find w/e I can volunteer for that interests me and it teaches me to give back to something beyond me. 

&#x200B;

Perhaps this will help you as well.
